@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8088

### 默认离线状态
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mcp/status

### remote profile 连接后查询允许的计算工具
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mcp/tools

### 调用基础计算
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mcp/tools/basic-calculation
Content-Type: application/json

{"a":12,"b":3,"operation":"+"}

### 工具业务错误：检查 isError，不只看 HTTP 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mcp/tools/basic-calculation
Content-Type: application/json

{"a":12,"b":0,"operation":"/"}

### 应返回 403，不调用 MCP 文件工具
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mcp/tools/delete-file
Content-Type: application/json

{"fileName":"example.txt"}
